# Explicitly declared columns over ProductOrders (headers default to the field names); ProductID is the generated key 1001 + row index.
Then this grid will have the header cells with the following text: ProductID, ProductName, ProductPrice, City, Country, CountryFlag
Then this grid will have data cells with these values in the visible rows:
  | ProductID |
  | 1001      |
  | 1002      |
  | 1003      |
  | 1004      |
